sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client
    participant Api as API
    Client->>+Api: Open a session
    create participant Session
    Api->>Session: Start
    alt Session found
        Session-->>Api: Resume
    else Session expired
        Note over Api,Session: Nothing to resume
    else Session locked
        Note right of Session: Another tab holds it
        Session-->>Api: Locked
    end
    destroy Session
    Api-xSession: Close
    Api-->>-Client: Session ready
    Note over Client,Api: Written after the last message
